[{"title":"咏怀 其二十六","author":"孙元衡","text":"空宇本无声，自然发清响。\n含毫腼古今，操觚洞莽苍。\n思风吹言泉，大海春潮广。\n笔颖如剑锋，摧坚亦攻仰。\n亘古不平事，指画在孤掌。\n所思不能明，为君达遐想。\n搜刮及虫鱼，诛求到魍魉。\n珍驾税平林，延览得真赏。\n枕块憩虚恬，悠然成一往。\n方知功德外，音徽属吾党。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35047,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏怀 其二十七","author":"孙元衡","text":"凤弹有公田，高低麦与谷。\n雨旸失天时，荒秽走群鹿。\n家园二顷馀，子母暗相黩。\n坚好尽锱铢，追呼益穷蹙。\n卑官类逋窜，徇此五年禄。\n黄齑一百瓮，素餐仍碌碌。\n栈栈荆棘中，悲风吟古屋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35048,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏怀 其二十八","author":"孙元衡","text":"举头瞻碧落，与海混中边。\n朝光亦何满，夜色更澄鲜。\n两丸浮远界，列宿横飞烟。\n滔滔者奚适，苍苍兮无缘。\n理生一驹隙，所向恣缠绵。\n断我骨肉恩，南蛮共流年。\n娲鍊欲奚补，禽衔安可填。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35049,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏怀 其二十九","author":"孙元衡","text":"水光练天色，亭亭者余心。\n长风扇横波，逝日如已沈。\n藐躬忽忘返，与世为商参。\n海中有大鸟，修翎异凡禽。\n在天不厌高，在水不厌深。\n异境难久居，栖托求常林。\n徘徊枯与菀，中夜起哀音。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35050,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏怀 其三十","author":"孙元衡","text":"九皋鹤警露，九尾鸧警霜。\n微禽能变化，出群名故扬。\n饬躬古修士，守道如金汤。\n读书拔陈根，犹力耕我疆。\n崛起从人望，不异麟与凰。\n繄余拙禀气，蚩蚩等群氓。\n委身作秕稗，共此斗斛量。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35051,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨 其一","author":"孙元衡","text":"首夏经旬雨，天风历乱吹。\n瘴云深不动，海气幻多疑。\n迁木莺喉涩，营巢燕力迟。\n空堂成默坐，应遣鬓添丝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35052,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨 其二","author":"孙元衡","text":"檐溜惊飞瀑，坳堂似系舟；千花浑一落，东水尽西流。\n缦缦天边听，蘧蘧象外游。\n飘零今若此，无计洗离忧！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35053,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨止","author":"孙元衡","text":"草堂雨过胜林丘，竹榻横斜枕簟幽。\n素月函烟清露暗，归云似水众星浮。\n千忧一释秋将及，诸苦全消暑乍收。\n满院天香人静后，未知身在海东头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35054,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋日偶感","author":"孙元衡","text":"散步空庭独敛襟，此身端与世浮沈。\n凄迷海国看云地，宛转秋宵对月心。\n那得来鸿逢去燕，每思红叶间青林。\n大都百物无聊赖，满耳寒螀不是吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35055,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"书室小院，广不盈丈，友人方子隽年随手涉趣，便成幽赏，授简赋诗，得山字","author":"孙元衡","text":"盘错成幽簇，镌劖破古顽。\n阶前新畛域，盆内小湖山。\n护竹斜添槛，移屏曲隐关。\n荔枝樽酒绿，相就一开颜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35056,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"揽镜 其一","author":"孙元衡","text":"东归新镊一霜髭，不遣妻看怕婢知。\n白到于今曾不恨，青铜閒对数银丝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35057,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"揽镜 其二","author":"孙元衡","text":"半生魂梦总飞扬，关塞须眉气老苍。\n更莫自疑还独笑，鬓边不是点吴霜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35058,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海外惊霜叱雪，无复寒林可观。秋日行经木冈山下，白茅作花，宛如朔雪晨霜，足补山川所不逮，率简澄庵宋明府","author":"孙元衡","text":"茫茫宿莽本荒涂，行到瀛南胜画图。\n夹路霜华随野阔，到山雪色共云铺。\n风微灞岸飘杨柳，月澹江天冷荻芦。\n黄犊一声三榼酒，海邦秋兴未全无。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35059,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"重九日偶题","author":"孙元衡","text":"黄菊难寻处士家，也无枫叶受霜华。\n海东秋思知多少，为问墙边消息花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35060,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"野宿水仙院","author":"孙元衡","text":"古庙孤村外，阴森竹树联。\n排空成翠幄，流响作山泉。\n药院潜遗老，沧湄奉水仙。\n绳床宜借我，惯著冷人眠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35061,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬日题旧社何秀才书堂 其一","author":"孙元衡","text":"便是佳山水，书堂得自然。\n庭无新种树，池有不枯泉。\n几砚惟粗具，茶瓜罕俗筵。\n小窗横竹榻，深稳足安眠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35062,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬日题旧社何秀才书堂 其二","author":"孙元衡","text":"欲行还辍驾，尘思坐来清。\n竹密翠相倚，榴寒火更明。\n游蜂喧午队，冻鸟作春声。\n讵羡南荒隐，悠悠计此生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35063,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题海边村落","author":"孙元衡","text":"天南景物正纷纭，瘴雨才过又夕曛。\n月渚寒山沈白浪，风林冬笋入青云。\n巢居泛宅俱成趣，荷锸施罛自有群。\n心忆江乡无别事，千峰飞雪酒微醺。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35064,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"遣兴 其一","author":"孙元衡","text":"齿颊添香生酒晕，槟榔古贲佐扶留。\n青青盛向金柈小，拾翠佳人减却愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35065,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"遣兴 其二","author":"孙元衡","text":"玻瓈浓露艳幽光，郑宅春芽斗粉枪。\n白嫩蛎房调最滑，绿肥龙虱细生香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35066,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台人服多不衷，戏为一绝","author":"孙元衡","text":"天涯风俗漫相亲，吴带曹衣迥不伦。\n无复屠苏障两耳，服妖今已被文身。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35067,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀故山 其一","author":"孙元衡","text":"为爱逃名念采薇，百年无恙一荆扉。\n行随远水何关乐，坐对南山似不饥。\n披草往来存礼数，提壶吟啸答芳菲。\n大都阅世难胜此，窘吏缨緌况墨徽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35068,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀故山 其二","author":"孙元衡","text":"丹枫岭上树生香，树里冈原我旧乡。\n饮露餐英赓楚些，轩鸿举凤赋山阳。\n衣冠故老谁天宝，松竹名园几辟疆？\n穷巷到今成寂寞，祗应高卧赞公房。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35069,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀故山 其三","author":"孙元衡","text":"幽栖昏晓?虚恬，俯仰无营乐事兼。\n谷鸟一声流竹径，山云几片就茅檐。\n花迷醉梦飞为蝶，月引诗魂化作蟾。\n须信为农能免俗，古狂真不畏人嫌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35070,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀故山 其四","author":"孙元衡","text":"山重水复龙眠道，一壑一丘幽士栖。\n偶为荷薪临绝壁，故因行药溯清溪。\n入云密竹晴岚帚，过岭高田绿野梯。\n万事等閒如昨日，即今回首梦先迷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35071,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀故山 其五","author":"孙元衡","text":"东龙西龙山不深，入山翠壁总萧森。\n轻条密叶云为幄，飞液流膏玉有音。\n略彴屠苏交绿野，弦歌樵唱共芳林。\n梅边僧与丹砂客，廿载同游记昔吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35072,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀故山 其六","author":"孙元衡","text":"居游作息本来安，须省无忧在寡欢。\n一褐拥寒天似窄，双锄除秽径原宽。\n池边醉帽停歌棹，梅里吟鞭拍冻鞍。\n海国行藏鲵鲋共，何时故境野盘桓？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35073,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"默坐二首 其一","author":"孙元衡","text":"久作无家别，而当零落时。\n逍遥忘六凿，贫僻谢三尸。\n习苦甘齑禄，知寒温被池。\n返真成槁寐，齧缺信余师。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35074,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"默坐二首 其二","author":"孙元衡","text":"?结宣苏尽，黄庭或可栖。\n观心收野马，论道见醯鸡。\n兀尔有恒干，熙然无勃溪。\n室中尘虑绝，门外海云齐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35075,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"日入行","author":"孙元衡","text":"赤嵌东山高万丈，金方溟涨天为池。\n羲和驾驭火鞭疾，霞车虹靷来何迟！\n未旰登台望蒙谷，虞泉下掬临崦嵫。\n是日天海明无翳，冉冉崇盖观西驰。\n火轮渐低光转近，与海鳞甲交离离。\n初没半轮如合璧，神芒百道兼千丝。\n骊珠既堕萍实隐，九瀛化冶金镕时。\n踆鸟戢翼不我与，烛龙低首焉能为。\n阳气接戍便灰死，暡曚晻暧徒逶迤。\n巨浪翻空忽腾沸，万烽并举边人疑。\n谽呀豁閜舒长影，爚爚震震焚其逵。\n烈燄烘云烦煅鍊，洪炉煮海还蒸炊。\n佛国明灯不知夜，神丘火穴良可窥。\n燊燊应符再中瑞，辉辉拟见连珠奇。\n空中长绳逝欲挽，河上杖策行当追。\n戈挥三舍战未已，射落九驭苏来随。\n西隅白虎其宿昴，功成宜退胡相稽。\n长留山头少皞语，天目未闭诸神嬉。\n伫立荒台莲漏下，燋烟灭尽星光垂。\n忆昔山东登日观，峰头道士能狂痴。\n天鸡一唱呼我起，岩峦远接扶桑枝。\n金柱红盆耀溟渤，三山隐见浮蛟螭。\n大地光明杳何极，梦魂往往亲重曦。\n焉知落拓沧洲外，断蓬却逐西倾葵。\n生死浮沈吁可怪，寸心炯炯无人知！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35076,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏柚花，用东坡喜王仲玉惠稚稚诗韵","author":"孙元衡","text":"海东有嘉树，橚矗春庭阴。\n坐使江淮客，结想昆崙岑。\n素华乱香雪，绿珠纷宝林。\n颇闻骚雅贵，不受樵牧侵。\n新叶浮翠蒂，故枝攒棘针。\n焜煌修贡职，雕饰酬知音。\n况乃烟霜质，复此吴越禽。\n凯风温白玉，杲日待黄金。\n一花已堪把，独树良亦深。\n未邀宠兰佩，取足曜华簪。\n零落暌幽赏，芬芳偕夙心。\n暇日酌君酒，閒谣披我衿。\n枳刺徒磊磊，桃实自森森。\n楚岸远千里，蜀崖高万寻。\n放游悲已昔，遐瞩感自今。\n为因郭生赞，思与灵均吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35077,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日农圃言 其一","author":"孙元衡","text":"老农饮春酒，向客舞婆娑；手中执双壤，将以歌太和。\n我豕突阴壑，我牛砺阳坡；鹅黄鸭头绿，池平水不波。\n二月刈新麦，三月布新禾。\n一丘输五斔，所用未为多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35078,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春日农圃言 其二","author":"孙元衡","text":"步入西园中，三径被苔藓。\n瓜叶尽绵蛮，归心欣欲展。\n老圃为我言，此乐良不浅。\n瓜田初辟时，滋蔓甚繁衍。\n子母互钩带，陆离灿朝睍。\n凿破水晶寒，琢成红玉软。\n远产珍先时，岁输例常典。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35079,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"安平镇","author":"孙元衡","text":"浮空巨镇海云齐，七点鲲身踞水犀。\n潮趁去来分顺逆，风乘朝暮便东西。\n空城一任生禾黍，老将应知厌鼓鼙。\n战舸如山乌在幕，千樯影静夕阳低。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35080,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"草堂落成","author":"孙元衡","text":"一亩宫初辟，情奇境自遥。\n移根将笋竹，分本作花蕉。\n炉外安棋局，瓶边挂酒瓢。\n人间无用地，应不碍鹪鹩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35081,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和筱岫次韵元微之咏醉十二篇 其一 先醉","author":"孙元衡","text":"浮生端藉酒为名，坐遣宜城一笑倾。\n月正明时花未落，玉山颓处亦多情！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35082,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和筱岫次韵元微之咏醉十二篇 其二 独醉","author":"孙元衡","text":"一室酣酣瓮牖春，暖风轻似逐珠尘。\n有时相劝但孤影，明月入怀吾两人！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35083,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和筱岫次韵元微之咏醉十二篇 其三 宿醉","author":"孙元衡","text":"领发不簪行自由，下阶拾得旧花筹。\n即今相对浑如梦，消尽人间隔夜愁！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35084,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和筱岫次韵元微之咏醉十二篇 其四 惧醉","author":"孙元衡","text":"须省春风料峭寒，几堪狼藉对杯盘。\n个中清兴争些子，珍重人间夜未阑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35085,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和筱岫次韵元微之咏醉十二篇 其五 羡醉","author":"孙元衡","text":"忍得朝饥耐独眠，不憎人不乞人怜。\n但能强起仍扶去，最好山中未醒年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35086,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和筱岫次韵元微之咏醉十二篇 其六 忆醉","author":"孙元衡","text":"洛阳酒会从前事，金谷诗人少后期。\n三百青铜随地数，凌风玉树早花时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35087,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和筱岫次韵元微之咏醉十二篇 其七 病醉","author":"孙元衡","text":"痴魂夜共青灯烬，老眼朝惭玉镜窥。\n道是解酲须五斗，扶头莫避最深卮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35088,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和筱岫次韵元微之咏醉十二篇 其八 拟醉","author":"孙元衡","text":"一向不沾尘里事，百般齐付掌中杯。\n坐移密树听莺罢，笑逐清风猎蕙来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35089,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和筱岫次韵元微之咏醉十二篇 其九 劝醉","author":"孙元衡","text":"落来山色云同泛，送去春寒雪自消。\n风月眼前容我在，未应花外问来朝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35090,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和筱岫次韵元微之咏醉十二篇 其十 任醉","author":"孙元衡","text":"惠山泉水真宜酿，满载吴船万里来。\n闻道百川皆到海，长鲸捲浪入深杯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35091,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和筱岫次韵元微之咏醉十二篇 其十一 同醉","author":"孙元衡","text":"招来纵浪酒中人，直似陶潜影答神。\n莫逆于心相视笑，山花开遍不知春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35092,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和筱岫次韵元微之咏醉十二篇 其十二 狂醉","author":"孙元衡","text":"墨阳斩得愁根断，消受东皇太乙春。\n白水阆风凭策马，洧盘穷石更无人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35093,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄惠州张别驾青臣","author":"孙元衡","text":"蓬莱左股任跻攀，身寄中原一发间。\n月共美人樽尚在，云移仙客履初还。\n玉鳐春柱尝新味，朱橘霜皮驻好颜。\n绝胜荷兰初辟地，鲵居鲋入斗蛙蛮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35094,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂谣十首 其一","author":"孙元衡","text":"上山伐檀日已曛，檕迷駮马还当分。\n朝光满盈明四目，胸罗万镜当人群。\n鱼龙出没吁可怪，丛岛攒峰云出云。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35095,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂谣十首 其二","author":"孙元衡","text":"惟笔有颖剑有锋，附耳之言何从容？\n默而微笑甘可悦，联绵奚啻九疑峰。\n我生不作嚅嗫语，率尔出口如扣钟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35096,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂谣十首 其三","author":"孙元衡","text":"含沙伏蛊其事微，水弩夜夜随行晖。\n大人无心坐观鼻，不因鬼物张天机。\n要使蜩蛇遗甲蜕，并令鱼兔忘筌蹄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35097,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂谣十首 其四","author":"孙元衡","text":"担囊学道远辞家，白舲黄犊走天涯。\n观海奚止九云梦，入山不啻千袤斜。\n安能飘飖游八极，奇肱国驭从风车！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35098,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂谣十首 其五","author":"孙元衡","text":"群鸡啄黍正朱朱，采莫归来日已晡。\n满堂宾客无颜色，不能出户兴嗟吁。\n金椎控颐口含珠，髑髅昔是衣冠儒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35099,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂谣十首 其六","author":"孙元衡","text":"鱼钩奚取于直针？\n鸟罗焉用夫一目？\n寸筳安可撞洪钟？\n尺木岂能支夏屋？\n我独胡为在荒服？\n寒蝉不鸣雌鸡伏！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35100,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂谣十首 其七","author":"孙元衡","text":"方水出玉珠圆折，聆龙暩渊凤窥穴。\n潢潢白海为窟魁，吸吸青云瞻列缺。\n阳坡草短卧牂羊，阴壑泉枯行跛鳌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35101,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂谣十首 其八","author":"孙元衡","text":"中心蒶蕴生百忧，大冠修剑守枯丘。\n睚眦不解窜荆棘，微瑕累重千州留。\n隐伏万事迫支体，挺解销铄无时休。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35102,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂谣十首 其九","author":"孙元衡","text":"从军十五颜如花，二十颇解为骄奢。\n大言猛气两无敌，手挽天河翻日车。\n白头老卒守寒圃，钩带离离子母瓜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35103,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂谣十首 其十","author":"孙元衡","text":"燕石鱼目重如宝，凤逐山鸡雁随鸨。\n美人一笑果倾城，痴骨妍皮彰媚好。\n南山之兽人所珍，虎文羊质饱枯草。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35104,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题林秀才池馆","author":"孙元衡","text":"脱俗自成趣，园林物外閒。\n桄郎团竹坞，羡子亚荆关。\n雨过活枯涧，烟销瘦小山。\n吾知谢灵运，到此不思还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35105,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"郊外","author":"孙元衡","text":"出门尘事少，原野自逍遥。\n鱼跃池还静，莺啼花更娇。\n短章惟诵酒，长啸可迎潮。\n最爱茄冬树，标青上碧霄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35106,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠海客","author":"孙元衡","text":"头白不须怜，安居已是仙。\n閒门迟过鸟，孤屿得遥天。\n潮视盈亏月，风随顺逆船。\n此中堪玩世，知有太平年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35107,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"听海客言，寄嘲北庄友人","author":"孙元衡","text":"道是求仙历险艰，半思利涉半跻攀。\n千条岐路迷银矿，一片晴云想玉山。\n贪挹龙涎乘莽葛，竞驱墨豹逐蜂蛮。\n非关海客谈言妄，纵到瀛洲未肯閒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35108,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"因海客言勖文士","author":"孙元衡","text":"七尺乘时思建勋，偶然失路随人群。\n有生最乐独良友，与世不死惟高文。\n楠干始萌裂地骨，鹏雏初奋垂天云。\n沙虫猿鹤从所化，雌伏雄飞谁与分。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":35109,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]